Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:02.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2}La Navidad se vive\Ncon el corazón
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2}Abrazos que reconfortan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:05.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2}miradas cómplices…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.62,0:00:07.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2}y velas que lo llenan\Ntodo de calidez
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:08.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2}Este año,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2}regálate un\Nmomento especial…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.55,0:00:12.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2}o regálaselo a\Nquien más quieres
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:14.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2}Ven y reserva\Ntu sesión
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2}con {\c&H009AA8F2&}Rosa{\c&H00FFFFFF&} para estas\Nfechas tan mágicas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:19.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2}Los huecos de\Ndiciembre vuelan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.25,0:00:21.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2}así que no lo dejes\Npara el final
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:23.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2}Escríbele por\Nmensaje directo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:25.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2}y haz de esta Navidad\Nalgo inolvidable
